# Memory Bank

Before non-trivial work, read all files in `memory-bank/` (especially `activeContext.md` and `progress.md`). They are the session bridge after context resets.

## Hierarchy

```
projectbrief.md → productContext.md / systemPatterns.md / techContext.md
                → activeContext.md → progress.md
```

## Update when

- Significant implementation lands
- Decisions change
- User says **update memory bank** (review every file; focus on `activeContext.md` and `progress.md`)

## Domain sources (prefer over guessing)

- `CONTEXT.md` — glossary (Visibility, Guest, Move rejection)
- `ARCHITECTURE.md` — target system; check “Implementation status”
- `docs/adr/` — rationale for irreversible choices
- `PRD.md` — product requirements

Do not re-introduce custom guest UUID / dual guest-id columns or client reads of true active FEN — those are superseded by ADRs 0001 and 0005.
